    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div id=&#34;gallery-6b2a75a8258187777b0101e410542835&#34; class=&#34;gallery&#34;&gt;
  
  
    
    
&lt;a class=&#34;grid-w50 pb-4 text-center&#34; href=&#34;https://www.cambus-tw.com/proimages/sr/design/index_pro1.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34;&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;https://mis3085.github.io/docs-cambus-tw/index_pro1_13212778812572303544.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Cavi ECG a 10 Derivazioni&#34; class=&#34;mx-auto max-w-full h-auto&#34;/&gt;Cavi ECG a 10 Derivazioni&lt;/a&gt;
